#. [scenario]: id=01_Defend_the_Forest
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:13
msgid "Defend the Forest"
msgstr "Branite gozd"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:26
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The arrival of humans and orcs caused turmoil among the nations of the Great "
"Continent. Elves, previously in uneasy balance with dwarves and others, had "
"for centuries fought nothing more than an occasional skirmish. They were to "
"find themselves facing conflicts of a long-forgotten intensity."
msgstr ""
"Prihod ljudi in orkov je močno pretresel stare prebivalce Velikega "
"kontinenta. Vilini, ki so do tedaj živeli v krhkem ravnotežju s škrati in "
"drugimi, se že stoletja niso z nikomer bojevali, z izjemo reševanja manjših "
"sporov. A kmalu se bodo morali soočiti s sovraštvom, kakršnega že dolgo ne "
"pomnijo."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:30
msgid ""
"Their first encounter with the newcomers went less well than either side "
"might have wished."
msgstr ""
"Niti oni niti prišleki niso bili zadovoljni z izidom njihovega prvega "
"srečanja."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:34
msgid ""
"But humans, though crude and brash, at least had in them a creative spark "
"which elves could recognize as akin to their own nature. Orcs seemed "
"completely alien."
msgstr ""
"Toda za razliko od orkov, ki so jim bili popolnoma tuji, se je zdelo, da v "
"ljudeh tli ustvarjalna iskrica, ki je viline spominjala na svojo lastno "
"naravo."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:38
msgid ""
"For some years after Haldric’s people landed, orcs remained scarce more than "
"a rumor to trouble the green fastnesses of the elves. That remained so until "
"the day that an elvish noble of ancient line, Erlornas by name, faced an "
"enemy unlike any he had ever met before."
msgstr ""
"Še nekaj let po prihodu Haldrikovega ljudstva so bili orki taka redkost, da "
"so se zgodbe o njih zdele bolj podobne govoricam, s katerimi bi drugi želeli "
"motiti vilinsko zeleno spokojnost. Tako je bilo vse do dneva, ko je vilinski "
"plemič iz starodavne rodbine, Erlornas po imenu, srečal sovražnika, s "
"kakršnim se ni spopadel še nikoli prej."

#. [part]
#. "northern marches" is *not* a typo for "northern marshes" here.
#. In archaic English, "march" means "border country".
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:44
msgid ""
"The orcs were first sighted from the north marches of the great forest of "
"Wesmere."
msgstr "Orke so prvič opazili iz severnih močvirij velikega Wesmerskega gozda."

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warrior, id=Urugha
#. [side]: type=Orcish Slayer, id=Gharlsa
#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=Gnargha
#. [side]: type={TYPE}
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:69
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:77
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:59
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:77
msgid "Orcs"
msgstr "Orki"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warrior, id=Urugha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:74
msgid "Urugha"
msgstr "Urugha"

#. [unit]: type=Elvish Rider, id=Lomarfel
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:94
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:387
msgid "Lomarfel"
msgstr "Lomarfel"

#. [message]: speaker=Lomarfel
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:112
msgid ""
"My lord! A party of aliens has made camp to the north and lays waste to the "
"forest. Our scouts believe it’s a band of orcs."
msgstr ""
"Gospod! Skupina neznancev se je utaborila severno od nas in popolnoma "
"razdejala gozd! Naši izvidniki menijo, da gre za tolpo orkov!"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:116
msgid ""
"Orcs? It seems unlikely. The human king, Haldric, crushed them when they "
"landed on these shores, and since then they’ve been no more than a bogey "
"mothers use to scare the children."
msgstr ""
"Orkov? To se mi ne zdi verjetno. Človeški kralj, Haldrik, je ob prihodu strl "
"njihovo vojsko in od takrat naprej so orki le še v zgodbicah, s katerimi "
"mame strašijo svoje otroke."

#. [message]: speaker=Lomarfel
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:120
msgid ""
"So it seemed, my lord. Yet there is a band of them in the north cutting down "
"healthy trees by the dozen, and making great fires from the wood. They "
"trample the greensward into mud and do not even bury their foul dung. I "
"believe I can smell the stench even here."
msgstr ""
"Tako se je zdelo, gospod. A vendar se po severu klati njihova banda, ki seka "
"na ducate zdravih dreves in z njimi ustvarja velike ognje. Zelenje teptajo v "
"blato; še svojih ogabnih iztrebkov ne zakopavajo. Zdi se mi, da še od tu "
"voham tisti ogaben vonj!"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:124
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "So the grim tales of them prove true. They must not be allowed to "
#| "continue; we must banish this blight from our forests. I shall marshal "
#| "the wardens and drive them off. And the Council needs to hear of this; "
#| "take the message and return with reinforcements, there might be more of "
#| "them."
msgid ""
"So the grim tales of them prove true. They must not be allowed to continue; "
"we must banish this blight from our forests. I shall marshal the wardens and "
"drive them off. And the Council needs to hear of this; take the message and "
"return with reinforcements, for there might be more of them."
msgstr ""
"Se pravi, da so grozljive stare zgodbe resnične. Takega obnašanja ne moremo "
"več dovoliti, to golazen moramo pregnati iz naših gozdov! Zbral bom čuvaje "
"in jih pregnal od tod. Tudi Svet je potrebno obvestiti: sporoči jim novico "
"in se vrni z okrepitvami, če slučajno pride še več orkov."

#. [message]: speaker=Lomarfel
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:128
msgid "Yes, my lord!"
msgstr "Da, gospod!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:146
msgid "Defeat Urugha"
msgstr "Premagajte Urugho."

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:150
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:214
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:349
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:180
msgid "Death of Erlornas"
msgstr "Erlornasova smrt"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:160
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Hint:\n"
#| "Elves can move quickly and safely among the trees. Pick off the enemy "
#| "grunts with your archers from the safety of the forest."
msgid ""
"Elves can move quickly and safely among the trees. Pick off the enemy grunts "
"with your archers from the safety of the forest."
msgstr ""
"Namig:\n"
"Vilini se med drevesi premikajo varno in hitro. Iz varnosti gozda lahko vaši "
"lokostrelci pobijejo sovražnikove pretepače enega po enega."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:173
msgid ""
"Look at them. Big, slow, clumsy and hardly a bow in hand. Keep to the trees, "
"use your arrows and the day will be ours."
msgstr ""
"Samo poglej jih. Veliki, počasni, nerodni, komaj se znajdejo z lokom. Držite "
"se dreves, uporabljajte puščice in bitka bo naša!"

#. [message]: race=elf
#. the player hasn't recruited any Shamans. This message isn't shown if they have a Shaman, even if she has 0 xp.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:222
msgid ""
"My lord, none of our healers have experience on the battlefield. It pleases "
"me that they are safe, but if we should embark on a campaign then we will "
"surely need them alongside us in the battles ahead."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: race=elf
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:223
msgid ""
"female^My lord, none of our healers have experience on the battlefield. It "
"pleases me that they are safe, but if we should embark on a campaign then we "
"will surely need them alongside us in the battles ahead."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: race=elf
#. the player has recruited some Shamans but has lost all them (or managed to level a Sorceress)
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:237
msgid ""
"My lord, none of our surviving healers have experience on the battlefield. "
"It pains me to suggest that we should risk another, but if we should embark "
"on a campaign then we will surely need them alongside us in the battles "
"ahead."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: race=elf
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:238
msgid ""
"female^My lord, none of our surviving healers have experience on the "
"battlefield. It pains me to suggest that we should risk another, but if we "
"should embark on a campaign then we will surely need them alongside us in "
"the battles ahead."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:269
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I’ve been bested, but the combat wasn’t fair... A thousand curses on you, "
"withered coward! May you suffer... and when my master, Rualsha, finds you "
"may he wipe your people from the face of this earth!"
msgstr ""
"Premagali ste me, a ne v poštenem boju... bodite tisočkrat prekleti, "
"strahopetci posušeni! Upam, da boste trpeli do konca svojih dni! Naj vas moj "
"gospodar, Rualsha, izbriše z obličja zemlje, ko vas najde!"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:276
msgid ""
"Rualsha? Hmm... What if... Assemble a war-party, we need to scout north!"
msgstr ""
"Rualsha? Kaj če... hitro, zberite vojno odpravo! Prečesati moramo sever!"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#. role=advisor will always be a male unit of the Elvish Scout line.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:296
msgid "It’s hopeless; we’ve tried everything, and they’re still coming back."
msgstr "Brezupno je, vse smo poizkusili, pa še kar prihajajo!"

#. [message]: speaker=Urugha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:300
msgid ""
"Forward, you worthless worms! Look at them, they’re tired and afraid! You "
"killed their will to fight, now go and finish the job!"
msgstr ""
"Naprej, črvi ničvredni! Poglejte jih, utrujeni in prestrašeni so! Ubili ste "
"že njihovo voljo do vojskovanja, sedaj pa pojdite in dokončajte svoje delo!"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:304
msgid ""
"That cloud of dust on the horizon... flee! There’s more of the abominations "
"heading this way! Fall back before we’re outnumbered and crushed."
msgstr ""
"Ta oblak dima na obzorju... bežite! Še več gnusob prihaja! Umaknimo se, "
"preden nas preplavijo in uničijo."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:309
msgid ""
"Lord Erlornas didn’t drive the orcs back, although he and his warriors tried "
"their absolute best. When another war band arrived, elvish resistance "
"crumbled."
msgstr ""
"Kljub vsemu trudu plemenitemu Erlornasu ter njegovi vojski ni uspelo odbiti "
"orkov. Ko je prišla naslednja orkovska vojska, se je vilinska obramba sesula."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:314
msgid ""
"Of the ensuing events little is known, since much was lost in the chaos and "
"confusion, but one thing is painfully sure. Elves lost the campaign."
msgstr ""
"Ne vemo veliko o nadaljnih dogodkih, saj je bilo v vojni zmedi veliko "
"izgubljenega, a nekaj je boleče očitno: Vilini so kampanjo izgubili."

#. [scenario]: id=02_Wasteland
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:23
msgid "Wasteland"
msgstr "Puščava"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:38
msgid ""
"The path of the orcish war band was easy to follow — a wide swathe of "
"trampled ground through violated forest. Erlornas and his party swiftly "
"followed it north and west."
msgstr ""
"Sled orkovske tolpe bi bilo težko zgrešiti - široka gaz poteptanega rastja "
"in zlorabljenega gozda se je vila proti severozahodu. Erlornas in njegovi so "
"ji zlahka sledili."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:42
msgid ""
"As they fared further north the green forest thinned around them, slowly "
"fading into a barren and fallow country. The signs were obvious and "
"unmistakable — tree stumps, an occasional half-rotten tree felled long ago, "
"and dead wood around them in scarce grass. This had been forest once, like "
"the woods they called home. It had been murdered."
msgstr ""
"Ko so prodirali vedno višje na sever, je gozd okrog njih postajal vedno bolj "
"redek, dokler ga ni počasi zamenjala prazna in nerodovitna zemlja. Znakov ni "
"bilo mogoče spregledati: odrezani štori, na pol zgnita debla, posekana že "
"pred mnogo leti in mrtev gozd, preraščen z redko travo. To je nekdaj bil "
"gozd, ravno tak, kot pokriva njihov domači kraj. Umorili so ga."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:46
msgid ""
"There was no trail to be found here; wind and rain had erased the spoor. "
"Fortunately, there was no need of a trail; smoke on the horizon betrayed the "
"presence of their enemies."
msgstr ""
"Sled je postala neprepoznavna, izbrisala sta jo veter in dež. A na srečo je "
"niso več potrebovali, saj je stolp dima na obzorju izdajal prisotnost "
"njihovih sovražnikov."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:50
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Erlornas was near-certain they would find orcs there. No clan of dwarves "
"would break their ancient treaties with the elves in this way; humans were "
"never so... methodical in their destruction, and did not travel in "
"sufficiently large numbers in a north country they found too cold and damp "
"for comfort. The great question remained — would he find Rualsha?"
msgstr ""
"Erlornas je bil skoraj prepričan, da bodo tam našli orke. Noben škratji klan "
"ne bi prelomil svojih starih pogodb z Vilini na tak način. Ljudje pa tudi "
"niso bili tako... natančni v svojem uničevanju in še na sever niso nikoli "
"hodili v takem številu, saj je bilo tu podnebje za njih preveč mrzlo in "
"vlažno. Veliko vprašanje je torej bilo: bo našel Rualsho?"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:54
msgid ""
"Perhaps, but not here. The tribe this camp housed was too small to impress "
"fear on other orcs. Come next morning, the elves were prepared for battle."
msgstr ""
"Morda, a ne tu. Pleme, ki si je tu taborilo, je bilo premajhno, da bi "
"naredilo vtis na ostale orke. Do naslednjega jutra so bili Vilini "
"pripravljeni na boj."

#. [side]: type=Orcish Slayer, id=Gharlsa
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:82
msgid "Gharlsa"
msgstr "Gharlsa"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warrior, id=Krughnar
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:108
msgid "Rival Orcs"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warrior, id=Krughnar
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:113
msgid "Krughnar"
msgstr "Krughnar"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:174
msgid "The trail leads straight to this place, my lord."
msgstr "Sled nas je pripeljala naravnost do sem, gospod."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:178
msgid ""
"There is a keep ahead of us. How comes it that we know nothing of it? I "
"thought our borders were watched more carefully."
msgstr ""
"Pred nami stoji trdnjava - kako je mogoče, da ne vemo nič o njej? Mislil "
"sem, da so naše meje skrbno nadzorovane."

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:182
msgid ""
"I... I know not, my lord. For ages there was no one in these lands that "
"could build such a thing save us. I fear we have fallen prey a false sense "
"of security that has injured the vigilance of our scouts."
msgstr ""
"Ne.. ne vem, gospod. Že celo večnost ni bilo v tej deželi razen nas nikogar, "
"ki bi bil sposoben zgraditi kaj takega. Bojim se, da smo podlegli lažnemu "
"občutku varnosti, ki je zaslepil naše izvidnike."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:186
#, fuzzy
msgid "When the fighting ends, I’ll have some answers. But for now—"
msgstr "Ko bo vsega tega konec, bom zahteval odgovore! A do takrat.."

#. [message]: speaker=Gharlsa
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:190
#, fuzzy
msgid "Gharlsa sees elves... yes... Fresh meat for wolves. Yes, yes..."
msgstr ""
"Gharlsa videl vilince... krasno... naši volkovi jedli sveže meso... krasno, "
"krasno..."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:194
#, fuzzy
msgid "—let’s focus on the task at hand."
msgstr "..se moramo osredotočiti na bolj nujne zadeve."

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:198
msgid "Does that demented creature truly believe he can kill us?"
msgstr "Kaj to zmešano bitje res verjame, da nas lahko pobije?"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:202
msgid "Appearances can be deceiving. Tell the men to be cautious."
msgstr "Videz lahko vara. Povej možem, naj bodo previdni."

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:210
msgid "Defeat Gharlsa"
msgstr "Premagajte Gharlso"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:224
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Hint:\n"
#| "Assassins are hard to hit, and their poison is insidious. Stay close to "
#| "the villages, where poisoning can be cured, and force your enemies to "
#| "attack you from the river."
msgid ""
"Assassins are hard to hit, and their poison is insidious. Stay close to the "
"villages, where poisoning can be cured, and force your enemies to attack you "
"from the river."
msgstr ""
"Namig:\n"
"Morilce je težko zadeti, njihov strup pa je zelo zahrbten. Držite se blizu "
"vasi, saj se da v njih strup pozdraviti, in prisilite svoje sovražnike, da "
"vas napadejo iz reke."

#. [message]: speaker=Krughnar
#. Krughnar is a follower of Lich-Lord Selmar. He calls the other orcs traitors because they've rebelled, and follow Rualsha instead. The player doesn't know this yet.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:310
msgid ""
"I have caught you at last, traitorous Gharlsa! May your spirit suffer "
"greatly for your weakness!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Gharlsa
#. Gharlsa is a follower of Rualsha, another orc - not the Lich-Lord Selmar that Krughnar follows. The player doesn't know this yet.
#. "orcs only obey orcs" is also a similar theme to what Rualsha says in the final scenario
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:316
msgid ""
"Traitor? No... you betray. Gharlsa only obey orcs. Rualsha great orc. Yes, "
"yes... Rualsha true leader."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Krughnar
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:320
msgid ""
"Rise up, grunts! We have a great fight upon us! Let your rage flow freely! "
"Let your blades slay all! First one to draw blood will feast by my fire this "
"night!"
msgstr ""
"Vzdignite se, pretepači! Velika bitka je pred nami! Besnite kakor vam prija! "
"Naj vaši meči pokoljejo vse! Prvega od vas, ki bo prelil sovražnikovo kri, "
"bom to noč gostil ob mojem ognjišču!"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:333
msgid ""
"It seems this “Rualsha’s” leadership does not stand uncontested. The orcs "
"have turned their attention from us to their rival. The two camps mean to "
"destroy each other, and much of our forest in the process."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:337
msgid ""
"Aim true, men, with wit and courage the day will be ours. And spare no-one, "
"there can be no orc south of the hills, else we’ll never have peace again."
msgstr ""
"Natančno merite, možje, s pametjo in pogumom jih bomo premagali. Pa nikogar "
"ne pustite živeti, južno od hribovja noben ork ne sme ostati živ, sicer ne "
"bomo nikoli imeli miru."

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:345
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Defeat all enemy leaders"
msgid "Defeat both enemy leaders"
msgstr "Premagaj vse sovražnike"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:359
msgid ""
"Your enemies are focused on each other. Gather gold and build your army "
"while they exhaust their armies, then move in and finish them off."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Gharlsa
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:379
#, fuzzy
msgid "Yes... yes... Slay them!"
msgstr "Krasno, krasno... razmesarite jih!"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:396
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hurts... failed... Rualsha gonna be angry..."
msgstr "Boli... izgubili... Rualsha bo jezen..."

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:412
#, fuzzy
msgid "You won... Elf... But it changes... Nothing... (*cough*)"
msgstr "Zmagal si... Vilin... A to ne spremeni... ničesar... (*kreh*)"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:416
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We found the way... Now... We will come in numbers... (*cough*) You can’t "
"imagine..."
msgstr ""
"Našli smo vas... in sedaj... nas bo prišlo veliko... (*kreh*) Ne moreš si "
"predstavljati..."

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:420
#, fuzzy
msgid "(*cough*) I’ll be waiting... Among the dead..."
msgstr "(*kreh*) Čakal bom nate... med ostalimi mrtveci..."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:452
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The orcish chieftain finally fell, overcome by his wounds. The elves "
#| "found themselves in a half-ruined camp littered with the bodies of both "
#| "sides.There was no hale orc in sight, nor did any of the wounded beg "
#| "mercy. The elves took no prisoners."
msgid ""
"The orcish chieftain finally fell, overcome by his wounds. The elves found "
"themselves in a half-ruined camp littered with the bodies of both sides, "
"there was no hale orc in sight, nor did any of the wounded beg mercy. The "
"elves took no prisoners."
msgstr ""
"Poglavar orkov je bil končno premagan, njegove rane so bile prehude. V na "
"pol porušenem taboru, prekritem s trupli iz obeh vojska, niso Vilini našli "
"niti enega zdravega orka več, prav tako pa nobeden od ranjenih orkov ni "
"prosil za milost. Zajeli niso nobenega ujetnika."

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:461
msgid ""
"It’s done, lord. No-one escaped. No-one tried to escape. I’m... disturbed."
msgstr ""
"Končano je, gospod. Nihče ni pobegnil. Zmotilo me je to, da nihče ni niti "
"skušal pobegniti."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:465
msgid ""
"Good. But their disregard for self-preservation is astounding. As is their "
"ferocity when defending what they claim as their own. Have the scouts found "
"others this side of the hills?"
msgstr ""
"Dobro ste opravili. Toda kako malo jih je zanimalo lastno preživetje in ta "
"zagrizenost, s katero so branili 'svojo' zemljo.. skoraj ne morem verjeti. "
"So naši izvidniki izsledili še kakšne druge orke na tej strani hribovja?"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:469
msgid ""
"No, lord. But trolls were spotted in the hills ahead. Do we really need to "
"cross them to the north?"
msgstr ""
"Ne, gospod. Toda v bližnjih hribih so videli trole. Moramo res iti tam čez, "
"če hočemo prodreti naprej na sever?"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:473
msgid ""
"Yes. The council has spoken to me through a dream-sending. They are "
"troubled. Reinforcements have been sent after us, but we need to press on. "
"Tell the men to rest, we’ll move out at dawn."
msgstr ""
"Moramo. Svet je govoril z mano v sanjah, skrbi jih. Za nami so poslali "
"okrepitve, toda mi moramo iti naprej. Povej možem, naj si spočijejo. Takoj "
"ko se zdani, krenemo naprej."

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:491
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "We can’t carry on Lord, the men are too tired. We have to fall back."
msgid "We can’t carry on, lord, the men are too tired. We have to fall back."
msgstr ""
"Ne moremo naprej, gospod, možje so preveč utrujeni. Moramo se umakniti."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:495
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Damn it. Sound the retreat, we’ll try again when reinforcements arrive."
msgid "Sound the retreat, we’ll try again when reinforcements arrive."
msgstr ""
"Prekleto! Razglasite umik in ko pridejo okrepitve, bomo poizkusili znova."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:500
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The expected relief caught up with them a few days later. The following "
"morning they took the field against a far larger host of orcs. The battle "
"ended in a draw; the war raged on for years..."
msgstr ""
"Težko pričakovane okrepitve so jih dohitele šele čez nekaj dni. Naslednje "
"jutro so se ponovno podali na bojno polje, kjer jih je čakala mnogo večja "
"orkovska vojska. Bitka se je končala neodločeno, vojna pa je trajala še "
"mnogo let ..."

#. [scenario]: id=03_Valley_of_Trolls
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:22
msgid "Valley of Trolls"
msgstr "Dolina trolov"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:36
msgid ""
"Next morning, the elves set off again, increasingly wearied by the hardships "
"of the campaign and longing for the green comfort of their home forests. "
"This land was barren and rugged; nothing shielded them from biting northern "
"wind as they traveled towards the mountains looming before them."
msgstr ""
"Naslednje jutro so se Vilini odpravili naprej, utrujeni od fizičnih naporov "
"vojskovanja in hrepeneč po udobju svojih zelenih gozdov. Ko so potovali "
"proti gorovju, ki se je grozeče dvigalo pred njimi, je bila dežela prazna in "
"razbrazdana. Nič jih ni ščitilo pred strupeno mrzlim severnim vetrom."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:40
msgid ""
"At dusk they arrived at the mouth of a valley cutting almost straight "
"through the range and made camp, as scouts warned that the area was hostile "
"and the road ahead treacherous in darkness. There were no songs or music "
"that night and most of the elves slept uneasily. An unlucky few kept a "
"cautious watch."
msgstr ""
"Mračilo se je že, ko so prispeli do ustja doline, ki je sekala gorovje na "
"dvoje. Zaradi poročil izvidnikov, da so v bližini sovražniki, pot pa v temi "
"nevarna, so se utaborili. Tisto noč se iz njihovega tabora ni slišalo niti "
"petja niti glasbe in večina vilinov je imela nemiren spanec. Nekaj "
"nesrečnežev je pozorno bedelo na straži."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:44
msgid ""
"When sunrise came, the elves moved into battle formations. Whatever waited "
"in the slopes ahead, it would not find them unprepared."
msgstr ""
"Ko se je zdanilo, so se Vilini postavili v bojne položaje. Karkoli je že "
"čakalo na njih v pobočjih, jih ne bo ujelo nepripravljenih."

#. [side]: type={TYPE}
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:68
msgid "Trolls"
msgstr "Troli"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:135
msgid ""
"We are far from our lands, now, Erlornas, and we have driven the orcs from "
"the forest. Why do we not return home?"
msgstr ""
"Daleč zdoma smo, Erlornas, orke pa smo tudi že pregnali iz gozda. Zakaj se "
"nebi vrnili domov?"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:139
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You know well enough... Rualsha. That name sounds everywhere we go since the "
"incursion began. That orc is much more than a mere marauding bandit in "
"search of pillage. And he wants this land. <i>Our</i> land. He is planning "
"an invasion, I’m sure of it. We must gather more information about his plans "
"before we go back."
msgstr ""
"Veš zakaj... Rualsha. To ime smo slišali povsod, kamorkoli smo šli od "
"začetka orkovskega vpada. Ta ork ni zgolj ropar, ki išče priložnostni plen. "
"To deželo, *našo* deželo, hoče imeti sam zase. Prepričan sem, da pripravlja "
"invazijo. Preden se vrnemo nazaj domov  moramo zbrati več informacij."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:143
msgid "And tell me... How did you sleep last night?"
msgstr "Pa še to mi povej: kako si spal to noč?"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:147
msgid ""
"How did I?... Uneasy, lord. My dreams were bleak, some of them nightmares."
msgstr ""
"Kako sem spal? Slabo, gospod. Imel sem slabe sanje, nekatere so bile prave "
"nočne more."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:151
msgid ""
"Yes. The earth currents are perturbed here, and the bridges to the dreamland "
"are tainted. I think there is a mage dwelling somewhere nearby. Or perhaps "
"more than one; the traces are mixed, and some of them have an unwholesome "
"flavor."
msgstr ""
"Tudi jaz. Tokovi zemlje so bili tu naokoli zmoteni, mostovi do sanjskega "
"sveta pa izprijeni. Rekel bi, da mora biti v bližini kakšen čarovnik, morda "
"celo več čarovnikov. Moje slutnje so glede tega nejasne, nekatere od njih pa "
"prav grozljive."

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:155
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "It would be dire indeed for us if these orcs have magic to add to their "
#| "battle-might."
msgid ""
"It would be dire indeed for us, if these orcs have magic to add to their "
"battle-might."
msgstr ""
"To bi bilo res grozno, da bi orki na svoji strani imeli čarovnike. Magija bi "
"močno povečala njihovo bojno moč."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:159
msgid "We must discover if this is so."
msgstr "Ugotoviti moramo, če je v teh slutnjah kaj resnice."

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:163
msgid ""
"Information will do us no good if we are killed before we return with it! "
"These mountains look like troll territory."
msgstr ""
"Če se sploh ne vrnemo domov, nam bodo informacije bolj malo koristile! Te "
"gore izgledajo primerne, da bi v njih lahko živeli troli."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:167
msgid "Enough. The sun’s fully over the horizon. Give the order to advance."
msgstr ""
"Dovolj govorjenja, sonce je že v celoti vzšlo. Ukaži enotam, naj se začnejo "
"pomikati naprej."

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:176
msgid "Move Erlornas to the west edge of the map"
msgstr ""

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:190
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Hint:\n"
#| "Trolls are poor fighters when not on rugged terrain and fare even worse "
#| "during the daytime. Lure them out of the hills and attack in the sunlight."
msgid ""
"Trolls are poor fighters when not on rugged terrain and fare even worse "
"during the daytime. Lure them out of the hills and attack in the sunlight."
msgstr ""
"Namig:\n"
"Troli so na ravnih področjih slabi bojevniki, še slabše pa se obnesejo "
"podnevi. Zvabite jih dol s hribov in napadite podnevi."

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:207
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:257
msgid "Dis not over! Rualsha gonna make you pay!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:211
msgid ""
"The chieftain blocking the pass is slain, lord. The way forward is clear."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:244
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "It is well. Break camp and move everyone through the pass before they "
#| "rally. We’ll rest a bit on the other side; we have earned it."
msgid ""
"I have fought my way through. Break camp and move everyone through the pass "
"before they rally. We’ll rest a bit on the other side; we have earned it."
msgstr ""
"To je dobro. Podrite tabor, vsi moramo priti skozi dolino, preden se ponovno "
"zberejo v večjem številu. Ko pridemo na drugo stran, si bomo vzeli nekaj "
"časa za zasluženi počitek."

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:248
msgid "At once. How much time do you think we have?"
msgstr "Takoj! Koliko časa mislite, da imamo?"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:252
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "A day, perhaps. We fought two clans today; they won’t take long to rally. "
#| "We need to be gone from here by sunset next."
msgid ""
"A day, perhaps. We fought three clans today; they won’t take long to rally. "
"We need to be gone from here by sunset next."
msgstr ""
"Največ kakšen dan. Danes smo se bojevali proti dvema klanoma; ne bodo "
"potrebovali dosti časa, da se spet zberejo. Od tu se moramo pobrati "
"najkasneje do naslednjega sončnega zahoda."

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:274
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We can’t get through, my lord. These whelps are not individually very "
"dangerous, but there are huge numbers of them."
msgstr ""
"Ne moremo skozi, gospod! Posamezno tile cucki morda že niso nevarni, a jih "
"je ogromno!"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:278
msgid ""
"Four days of combat and nothing to show for it. How does it feel to you?"
msgstr ""
"Po štirih dneh boja nimamo nič za pokazati. Kako se počutiš ob tej misli?"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:282
msgid ""
"Terrible, my lord. Never in my life did I dream I’d be bested by mere "
"trolls. What are your orders?"
msgstr ""
"Grozno, gospod. Nikoli v življenju si nisem mislil, da me bodo premagali "
"navadni troli. Kakšni so vaši ukazi?"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:286
msgid ""
"Withdraw and make camp a safe distance from the hills. There is no further "
"point in this fight. We’ll wait for reinforcements."
msgstr ""
"Umaknili se bomo in utaborili v varni razdalji od teh hribov. Nima smisla, "
"da nadaljujemo z bojem. Počakali bomo na okrepitve."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:291
msgid ""
"The reinforcements arrived a few days later, a crack force of rangers with "
"some cavalry support. When they attempted the pass again, they found not "
"trolls but something worse — an orcish army approaching from the north."
msgstr ""
"Okrepitve, posebna enota logarjev z nekaj konjeniške podpore, so prispele "
"nekaj dni kasneje. A ko so poizkušali ponovno prečkati dolino, so naleteli "
"na nekaj mnogo hujšega, kot na trole. S severa je prišla celotna orkovska "
"vojska."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:296
msgid ""
"The battle that ensued was bloody and inconclusive, and the elven losses "
"were only the beginning of the mournful toll in a war that would rage for "
"many years after."
msgstr ""
"Bitka je bila krvava in neodločena, vilinske izgube pa so bile samo prve iz "
"grozovite krvave cene, ki jo bo še zahtevala dolgoletna vojna z orki."

#. [scenario]: id=04_Linaera_the_Quick
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:13
msgid "Linaera the Quick"
msgstr "Hitra Linaera"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:27
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After a day of hard-earned rest the elves marched north again. This was "
"unknown country, not frequented even by Wesmere’s furthermost-faring scouts."
msgstr ""
"Po dnevu zasluženega počitka se je vilinska vojska ponovno odpravila na "
"sever. Ta dežela jim je bila popolnoma neznana, v njo se niso podajali niti "
"najbolj podjetni izvidniki Wesmera."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:31
msgid ""
"Two days’ travel later, the forward scouts reported another orcish warband "
"laying siege to a tower."
msgstr ""
"Po dveh dneh potovanja so izvidniki javili, da so opazili tolpo orkov, ki je "
"oblegala stolp."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:35
msgid ""
"Erlornas surveyed the siege from atop a small tree-covered hill overlooking "
"the tower valley..."
msgstr ""
"Erlornas je z vrha malega, z gozdom pokritega hriba, opazoval obleganje..."

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=Gnargha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:64
msgid "Gnargha"
msgstr "Gnargha"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:98
msgid "Mages"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:167
msgid "Report."
msgstr "Poročaj."

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:173
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A warband of orcs, no women or children among them, besieges a tower. It’s "
"of human design... but we are far from the lands granted to humans by "
"treaty, my lord Erlornas."
msgstr ""
"Bojna tolpa orkov, med njimi ni nobenih žensk ali otrok, oblega stolp. Stolp "
"izgleda človeški, kljub temu, da smo daleč od dežel, ki po pogodbi pripadajo "
"ljudem, gospod Erlornas."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:177
msgid ""
"Under the letter of the treaty, it is so. But this country is too cold and "
"barren for us. I wonder, what manner of human would choose to live here, far "
"from its kind? Hmmm..."
msgstr ""
"Res je, če vzamemo pogodbo dobesedno. A ta dežela je tako ali tako premrzla "
"in preveč pusta za nas. Le kdo izmed ljudi bi hotel živeti tu, tako daleč "
"stran od ostalih? Hmmm ..."

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:181
msgid "It trespasses, and should be driven out!"
msgstr "Saj je vseeno! Tu nimajo kaj iskati, pregnati jih moramo stran!"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:185
msgid ""
"Hold. It is only one human, or a few of them at most. Time enough to speak "
"of driving it out when we have no enemies in common."
msgstr ""
"Počakaj. Govorimo o enem, ali pa največ nekaj ljudeh. O tem, kako jih bomo "
"pregnali se lahko pogovarjamo kasneje, ko ne bomo imeli skupnih sovražnikov."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:189
msgid ""
"Tell me: I see no bridge over the chasm around that keep. Is there any sign "
"that one has been withdrawn by the defenders?"
msgstr ""
"Povej mi raje tole: nobenega mostu ne vidim čez prepad, ki obkroža njihovo "
"trdnjavo. Vidiš kakšen znak, da bi ga branilci pred napadom odstranili?"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:193
msgid ""
"No, lord. No traces of any construction. It looks like no bridge has ever "
"existed there. There must be other, hidden means of access to the tower."
msgstr ""
"Ne, gospod. Niti sledu gradnje ne vidim. Izgleda, kot da tu nikoli ni bilo "
"mostu. Gotovo mora obstajati kakšen drug, skriven prehod do stolpa."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:198
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Interesting... Go to my personal stores and bring me a bottle of wine. And a "
"couple of glasses."
msgstr ""
"Zanimivo.. Pojdi v mojo osebno shrambo in mi prinesi steklenico vina. Pa par "
"kozarcev."

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:203
#, fuzzy
msgid "... Glasses?"
msgstr "...kozarcev?"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:207
msgid "Do it. We’ll have a guest soon."
msgstr "Le prinesi. Kmalu bomo dobili gosta."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#. "Faerie" in this paragraph is a rare, poetic word in
#. English. It is the proper name of a magical otherworld
#. associated with elves - actually, originally with
#. fairies, but before Tolkien the boundary between elves
#. and fairies was extremely blurry. In Wesnoth it is
#. deliberately unclear whether Faerie is a place that is
#. the source of magical power or a label for the inner
#. nonhuman/magical nature of the Elves. Translate freely.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:222
msgid ""
"Erlornas closed his eyes and brought his hands forward, joined palms forming "
"a cup open to the sky. Soon they began to glow, then to flare like a brazier "
"with the fire of Faerie, casting a cold, blue light all around the elf-lord. "
"A wisp of light emerged from the eerie flames, and at a few murmured words "
"from the elf-lord flew away towards the tower below. Then the light around "
"Erlornas faded and all was seemingly as before."
msgstr ""
"Erlornas je zaprl oči in sklenil dlani skupaj, da so oblikovale čašo, odprto "
"proti nebu. Kmalu so roke začele žareti, potem pa kar goreti z vilinskim "
"ognjem, metajoč mrzlo, hladno svetlobo vse naokoli vilinskega mogočnika. Iz "
"plamena se je prikazala krogla svetlobe in po nekaj zamrmranih besedah "
"poletela dol proti stolpu. Takoj zatem je Erlornasov ogenj začel ugašati in "
"kmalu je spet vse izgledalo tako, kot prej."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:226
msgid "Some time later..."
msgstr "Malo kasneje..."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:250
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"So you decided to accept the invitation. Good. Welcome, I am Lord Erlornas "
"of Wesmere. I find your presence here... surprising."
msgstr ""
"Torej ste se odločili sprejeti moje vabilo. To me veseli. Dobrodošli, sem "
"mogočnik Erlornas iz Wesmera. Vaša prisotnost tu me... preseneča."

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:254
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Scarcely less than I find yours, my lord elf, but I would welcome your "
#| "aid against these orcs. They have been besieging my tower for weeks."
msgid ""
"Scarcely less than I find yours, my lord elf, but I would welcome your aid "
"against these orcs. They have been besieging my tower for weeks. I dare not "
"flee lest they chase me down."
msgstr ""
"Nič manj, kot vaša prisotnost preseneča mene, moj vilinski gospod. Bi pa "
"zelo cenila vašo pomoč proti tem orkom - že več tednov oblegajo moj stolp."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:258
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "I wish their foul kind driven as far as possible from my borders, not to "
#| "return. It would be no bad thing if an ally of the elves kept watch over "
#| "this country."
msgid ""
"I wish their foul kind driven as far as possible from my borders, not to "
"return. But you will explain your presence here before petitioning my aid. "
"These lands are not of those that were appointed to man."
msgstr ""
"Te pošasti bi radi pregnali čim dlje stran od naših meja, da se nikoli ne "
"vrnejo nazaj. Ne bi bilo slabo, če bi zaveznik vilinov stražil ta del dežele."

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#. "some import" (import having identical meaning as"importance") is under-selling it; a Lich-Lord is a very serious danger.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:263
msgid ""
"My apprentices and I have come to reconnoiter, regarding a danger of some "
"import. Perhaps you have sensed it too; black magic is in the air. A Lich-"
"Lord of the Green Isle holds dominion in these lands."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=advisor
#. The speaker is an elf, referring to a human king as "man-king" in the same way that a human might refer to an elf as an "elf-king".
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:268
msgid ""
"Preposterous. Lich-Lord Jevyan perished close to a decade ago, at the hands "
"of your man-king."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#. This is Lich-Lord Selmar from WoF.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:273
msgid ""
"This one calls himself Selmar. In his lair, he has opened a great stone gate "
"to the heart of the homeland of the orcs in the distant west. I probed the "
"gateway from afar for many days, before these orcs beheld me and pursued."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#. "those whose flesh can cross a chasm as easily as can a thought cross the mind" is a poetic way of referring to Linaera's teleportation.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:278
msgid ""
"More than probed, I see you have gleaned from its secrets. Few are those "
"whose flesh can cross a chasm as easily as can a thought cross the mind."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:282
msgid ""
"Silver magic — now I understand. So this is how these orcs have returned to "
"trouble us. If what you speak is true, I am certain the Council would agree: "
"this Lich-Lord must be slain and his portal quenched."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:286
msgid ""
"And what of Rualsha? The spectre of that name has haunted us ever since our "
"first encounter with these beasts."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:290
msgid ""
"That seems an orcish name, but I do not know its owner. I have been trapped "
"here for weeks, unable to reconnoiter nor report home."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:294
msgid ""
"Very well. Your petition for aid is granted, Linaera of the folk of Haldric. "
"Count me as an ally and we will defeat this threat together, beginning here."
msgstr ""

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:302
msgid "New Recruits"
msgstr ""

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:303
msgid "You can now recruit Mages."
msgstr ""

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:304
msgid ""
"Both Erlornas and Linaera can recruit and recall when standing on a keep."
msgstr ""

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:313
msgid "Defeat Gnargha"
msgstr "Premagajte Gnarhgo"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:317
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:228
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:467
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Death of Erlornas"
msgid "Death of Erlornas or Linaera"
msgstr "Erlornasova smrt"

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:368
msgid "And that is well ended. I stand in your debt, Erlornas of Wesmere."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#. "a threeday’s march" isn't a real word, but is an archaic-sounding way to say "three days’ march
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:373
msgid ""
"Indeed. But the greater threat remains; now I, too, sense the taint of this "
"orc-gate, scarce a threeday’s march away. We must go swiftly, across the "
"fields."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:377
msgid ""
"I should advise against it, lord elf. Orcs have wholly taken these lands, "
"swarming in great numbers over the plains and the hills. Traveling openly, "
"you will surely find yourself hunted."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:381
msgid "We have warred with orcs before, madame mage."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#. "skirmished" is in contrast to the previous line's "warred". A skirmish is much smaller in scale. Erlorans is saying they aren't prepared to fight huge bands of orcs.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:386
msgid ""
"We have <i>skirmished</i> with orcs. I should not be so quick to pit our "
"merry little band against all the vastness of the north. What counsel do you "
"tender, Linaera?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:390
msgid ""
"Near to us is a swamp, which extends some distance towards our goal. Evil "
"things have made a nest there; foul creatures born of the lich. But orcs "
"stay out of it, and there are firm paths on which to tread."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:394
msgid ""
"Very well. Support from Wesmere follows close in my wake, but we cannot "
"wait. I entrust your tower-keeper with my seal, and with directions for my "
"kin. We make for the swamp."
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:13
msgid "A Detour through the Swamp"
msgstr "Obvoz skozi močvirje"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:27
msgid ""
"Leaving their wounded to mend within Linaera’s tower, the remaining elves "
"and their human allies marched forth into the swamp. The rank stench of "
"decay surrounded them while insects and vermin churned in the earth."
msgstr ""

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:31
msgid ""
"The forward scouts soon reported signs of undead ahead. Erlornas moved the "
"elves into battle formations."
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type={ON_DIFFICULTY4 Necrophage Ghast Ghast Ghast}, id=leader2
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:56
msgid "Undead"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:195
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The evil spirits who have settled in this wetland have turned it into a "
#| "vile bog. My apprentices and I have the power to dispel them, but you "
#| "must protect us from their weapons."
msgid ""
"The evil spirits who have settled in this wetland have turned it into a vile "
"bog. I crossed here twice before by stealth, yet... this time something is "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Zlobni duhovi so se naselili tu in spremenili zemljo v zlovešče močvirje. "
"Jaz in moji učenci imamo moč, da jih odčaramo, toda ščititi nas boste morali "
"pred njihovimi orožji."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:202
msgid ""
"Look! These undead are injured, decaying from neglect. Their lich master "
"offers them no power. Where is the cruel will what first raised them from "
"the ground?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:206
msgid ""
"Lucky for us. We can reach our destination by the western way or the "
"northern way, though neither will be without its perils. Destroying the "
"undead leader should also suffice, although there is little need; it seems "
"these ones will soon crumble of their own accord."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:210
msgid ""
"Whichever path we take, we must be sure to prepare ourselves for the final "
"battle ahead. I fear we shall have need of all the gold and experience we "
"can gather ere we come to the gate."
msgstr ""

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:219
msgid "Move Erlornas to the north edge of the map"
msgstr ""

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:224
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Defeat all enemy leaders"
msgid "Defeat the enemy leader"
msgstr "Premagaj vse sovražnike"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:238
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Hint:\n"
#| "Undead are resistant to physical attack. Use mages to attack the undead, "
#| "and elves to protect and support the mages."
msgid ""
"Ghosts are resistant to physical attack. Use Mages to attack ghosts, and "
"elves to protect and support the Mages."
msgstr ""
"Namig:\n"
"Nemrtvi so odporni na fizične napade. Za napad na njih uporabite čarovnike, "
"Vilini pa naj jih ščitijo in podpirajo."

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:290
msgid ""
"Here is the corpse of an orc. He was felled perhaps two weeks ago, and by a "
"blade of his own kind’s make. Many more bodies lie deeper in the swamp."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:294
msgid ""
"The bodies also reek of dark magic, and the craters on this blasted land "
"bear witness to countless spells. I think orcs fought a great battle here, "
"against other orcs and undead. A battle for control of the gate, perhaps?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:298
msgid ""
"This swamp is not far from your tower. Should your magical senses not have "
"noticed this sooner?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:302
msgid ""
"To my inner eye the orc-gate is as a blazing inferno, bright enough to be "
"blinding. In comparison even a mighty blast of lightning would be but a "
"matchstick, and difficult to notice if I were not watching for it."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:306
msgid ""
"But now that I know what to look for, I feel similar magical scars all "
"around these lands. Whatever battle this was, this swamp is not the only "
"place it was fought. A mystery, but it bodes well for us — if there has been "
"fighting near the gate, its defenses may already be weakened."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. Said by the enemy leader (a Ghast) as it dies.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:337
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Ugh..."
msgid "..."
msgstr "Joj, ne!"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:372
msgid ""
"The end of our road lies close before us. Both the lich and its fell gate "
"must be brought to ruin. The one may be done by blade, but the other is a "
"thing wholly unknown to my folk."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:376
msgid ""
"Limited, personal teleportation notwithstanding, I grasp only the barest "
"fragments of the gateway’s working. In truth, I suspect all the sages of man "
"might study it for a dozen years and yet not fathom its creation."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:380
msgid ""
"But to answer your implied question: yes, I possess sufficient knowledge to "
"undo this creation of the Lich-Lords. We must first destroy the lich, as I "
"will require his body in order to dispel his magic."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:384
msgid ""
"You know a great deal of Lich-Lords, Linaera of the folk of Haldric. Yet you "
"say you have studied this portal only from afar, and for but some few days?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#. Linaera is one of the Wesfolk, and formerly lived in Jevyan's Haven. After the events of TRoW the Wesfolk have joined with Haldric to found the nation of Wesnoth.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:389
msgid ""
"I mingle with the men of Haldric, lord elf, but I am not counted among their "
"number. I am Wesfolk. I studied under Jevyan and dwelt in his Haven, ere the "
"betrayal. That is how I learned magery, and that is also why I and not "
"another was sent on this mission."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:393
msgid ""
"The works of this other Lich-Lord are newer to me. But with his bones, I am "
"confident I can undo his gate. It is far easier to destroy than to create, "
"lord elf; already you know this."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:397
msgid ""
"Indeed. The orcs know it as well, better than any among us; their senseless "
"destruction is... overwhelming. I fear what doom awaits Wesmere should we "
"fail. Let us press on."
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=06_Showdown
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:30
msgid "Showdown"
msgstr "Končni obračun"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:44
msgid ""
"Marching hard through the night, the sorely wearied elves emerged from the "
"swamp onto an arid plain. They gazed in dismay at the wasteland, strewn with "
"refuse, boot-prints, and the broken stumps of slaughtered trees. What plants "
"still clung to the meagre soil were blasted by cold, sandy winds."
msgstr ""

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:48
msgid ""
"Ahead, the very air hung heavy with enchantment. It grew hard to draw "
"breath. Rumbles and tremors in the earth bore witness to the power the Lich-"
"Lord had unleashed."
msgstr ""

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:52
msgid ""
"The scouts soon spotted orcs ahead, only to find the creatures engaged in an "
"unexpected work."
msgstr ""

#. [unit]: id=Rualsha, type=Orcish Sovereign
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:237
msgid "Rualsha"
msgstr "Rualsha"

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:310
msgid ""
"—you dared resist Rualsha! You were led astray by the lich! But now you are "
"beaten, and in defeat you see the truth. Do you swear fealty to me, and only "
"me?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=leader5
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:314
msgid "Yes, High Orc!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=helper5
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:318
msgid "Yes, King Rualsha!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#. WoF mentions that Lich-Lord Selmar is interested in summoning giants from the Old Continent. Giants aren't a faction in Wesnoth and probably never will be, but this is a nod to that.
#. These orcs just came from the Old Continent, so if there are giants there, these orcs would know about them.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:324
msgid ""
"Never again will orc bow to man, nor giant, nor lord of bones. Orc will only "
"bow to orc! And who is the greatest orc of all?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=helper5
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:328
msgid "You are, King Rualsha!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=leader5
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:334
msgid "My warriors obey only you!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:343
msgid "So you are Rualsha. At last we meet."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:347
msgid ""
"Raaahhh! Who dares interrupt me? Pointy ears... dainty wrists... snooty "
"nose... you must be elves."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#. Rualsha is the "Orcish Sovereign" unit. This is a nod to that, but not crucial to keep in the translation.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:352
msgid ""
"Indeed. We elves have heard your name many times, sovereign. Yet I was "
"unsure if I would find you here."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:356
msgid ""
"Ha! Am I not the gate-king you thought to meet? That wretched lich is dead, "
"felled weeks ago by my hand. He brought me here to do his bidding, but in "
"the end it was <b><i>me</i></b> who bested <b><i>him</i></b>."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#. the Orcish Sovereign's portrait includes a necklace of bones
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:361
msgid ""
"Now his portal is mine; his bones my trophy! The last of his followers have "
"sworn fealty to me, or else fallen under my blade!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:366
msgid ""
"Rualsha wears some of the lich’s bones around his neck. I must have them to "
"dispel the gate."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:370
msgid ""
"If you think to stop me, elf, you come too late. Thousands, hundreds of "
"thousands of orcs have already spread across the north."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#. "your jewel" refers to the Ruby of Fire, which we know the orcs tried to take in LoW. But this campaign isn't about the ruby, so it's only an oblique reference.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:375
msgid ""
"The lich was weak; he dared command only a few of those who came, for fear "
"of revolt. But I am strong, and I am orc; the hordes will gladly flock to my "
"banner. Your jewel will be mine, your forests reduced to firewood, and your "
"people left begging for a merciful death!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Lomarfel
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:400
msgid ""
"My lord! What is this terrible place? We have ridden hard for over a week to "
"catch up with you."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Lomarfel
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:429
msgid ""
"I bring a weighty war-chest and the reinforcements you requested from the "
"Ka’lian, Lord Erlornas. The council has deliberated, and sets in your hands "
"full authority over this matter of the orcs."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#. $amount will be between 150 and 75
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:441
msgid "You have gained $amount gold!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:451
msgid ""
"Fortunate is your hour of arrival, Lomarfel. I fear Rualsha’s host is too "
"great for us to vanquish in open battle, even with your aid. But the Rangers "
"who have come with you are skilled in stealth."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:455
msgid ""
"Even in the blasted ruins of this place, they can still pass veiled from "
"orcish gaze, and fall upon Rualsha from behind. Once the finishing blow is "
"struck, we will seal his portal and bring this matter to an end."
msgstr ""

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:463
#, fuzzy
msgid "Defeat Rualsha"
msgstr "Premagaj Rualsha-Tana"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:472
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your enemy is well-defended against attacks from the south. Use rangers to "
"sneak through the eastern forest and mount a surprise attack from the north."
msgstr ""
"Namig:\n"
"Vaš sovražnik je dobro okrepljen pred napadi z juga. Uporabite logarje, da "
"se prikradete na sever in od tam izvedete skrivni napad."

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:671
msgid "Aarrggh!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#. A Sylph or a Shyde has just tried to fly through a magical portal, but units can only exit from the portal, not enter it. The Sylph/Shyde took damage and was expelled from the portal. "flutter-rat" is a derogatory reference to their wings.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:676
msgid "One way only, flutter-rat."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#. Rualsha has just been attacked by an army of elves
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:702
msgid "I will have your heads!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#. Rualsha has just been ambushed by elves hiding in forest
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:709
msgid "Treachery! I will have your heads!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:734
msgid ""
"You may slay me, Erlornas, but my people live on. They will not forget! They "
"will pursue you, and destroy you utterly... we will... we... arrgh..."
msgstr ""
"Lahko me zakolješ, Erlornas, a moji ljudje bodo preživeli. Današnjega dne ne "
"bodo pozabili! Zasledovali te bodo in te popolnoma uničili.. mi bomo.. "
"arrghhh!"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:746
msgid "Now is our chance, Linaera!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:779
msgid ""
"The gate... I am overwhelmed by its power! To think that even Selmar, "
"weakest of the Lich-Lords, could sculpt a creation of this magnificence."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:783
msgid "Hurry! Destroy the foul thing before yet more orcs emerge!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:787
msgid ""
"So much Wesfolk knowledge has been lost, Erlornas. First in our flight from "
"the Old Continent, then by our wars on the Green Isle and the deaths of our "
"Lords. And now am I to destroy this, too: this final monument to the "
"greatness of my once-proud people?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:791
msgid "Alas. Such is the price of our survival."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:800
msgid ""
"As the orc drew his last ragged breath, the Wesfolk mage spoke a word and "
"cast forth her hand..."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:831
msgid "It is done."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:835
msgid ""
"We have won! The orcish warbands will scatter! In time the sands shall drink "
"deeply of their blood."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:839
msgid ""
"Perhaps. But I fear Rualsha spake truth. So many have already come through "
"the gate. If hundreds of thousands of orcs have already spread across the "
"north, how are we ever to be rid of them?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:843
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "I fear it will be so. We have won a first victory here, but dark times "
#| "come upon its heels."
msgid ""
"Come, we must hasten from this place while the way is yet clear. We have won "
"a first victory here, but I fear dark times will come upon its heels..."
msgstr ""
"Bojim se, da je res tako. Tu smo dosegli našo prvo zmago, a v njeni senci se "
"skrivajo temni časi."

#. [unit_type]: id=Gateway, race=undead
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/units/Gateway.cfg:4
msgid "Gateway"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=Gateway, race=undead
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/units/Gateway.cfg:22
msgid "A work of madness..."
msgstr ""

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/characters.cfg:20
msgid "Elves"
msgstr "Vilini"

#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/characters.cfg:50
msgid "Erlornas"
msgstr "Erlornas"

#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/characters.cfg:64
msgid "Linaera"
msgstr "Linaera"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:20
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr "Joj, ne!"

#. [message]: speaker=Urugha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:24
msgid "Finally! Got him!"
msgstr "Končno smo ga!"

#. [message]: race=elf
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:31
msgid "Lord!"
msgstr "Gospod!"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:35
#, fuzzy
msgid "Take... command... Drive them... away."
msgstr "Prevzemi...poveljstvo...preženite jih...daleč...stran..."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:42
msgid ""
"Lord Erlornas died the day he first fought the orcs and never saw the end of "
"the war. Given its final outcome, this was perhaps for the best."
msgstr ""
"Plemeniti Erlornas je umrl že na prvi dan svojega srečanja z orki. Morda je "
"bilo glede na končni izid tako še najboljše."

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:59
msgid "Ha! Me smashed da funny elf. Me got a trophy!"
msgstr "Ha! Jaz ubiti smešni vilin. Jaz sedaj imeti trofejo!"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:63
msgid "No! This can’t be!"
msgstr "Ne, to ne more biti res!"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:68
msgid ""
"Soon after Erlornas died, the elven party, lacking a leader and pressed from "
"all sides, scattered and fled. Their retreat to Wesmere was arduous and long."
msgstr ""
"Vilinska vojska, sedaj brez vodje in stisnjena z vseh strani, se je kmalu po "
"Erlornasovi smrti razkropila in zbežala. Njihova pot nazaj v Wesmere je bila "
"težka in dolga."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:72
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"During their retreat, the pass was crossed by another army moving in the "
"opposite direction. Orcs were back south of the pass, and this time they "
"were to stay for a long, long time."
msgstr ""
"Med tem, ko so se umikali, je dolino v obratno smer prečkala še druga "
"vojska. Orki so bili spet južno od prelaza in so tokrat tam ostali še dolgo, "
"dolgo časa."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:89
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Lord Erlornas never saw the blade that felled him. He died on the spot, "
#| "with not a chance to issue last commands or farewells. Without him his "
#| "wardens soon fell into confusion, and losing heart withdrew from the "
#| "battle."
msgid ""
"Lord Erlornas never saw the blade that felled him. He died on the spot, with "
"not a chance to issue last commands or farewells. Without him, his wardens "
"soon fell into confusion and, losing heart, withdrew from the battle."
msgstr ""
"Plemeniti Erlornas niti videl ni rezila, ki ga je pokončalo. Umrl je na licu "
"mesta, brez možnosti, da bi dal še zadnja navodila, ali pa se vsaj poslovil "
"od svojih tovarišev. Brez njega je ostale čuvaje zajela zmeda. Upadel jim je "
"pogum in umaknili so se iz boja."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:94
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "When reinforcements finally arrived, elves managed to dislodge the orcish "
#| "tribe. But the threat from the north remained unresolved and loomed large "
#| "over their future."
msgid ""
"When reinforcements finally arrived, elves managed to dislodge the orcish "
"tribe. But the threat from the north remained, casting a shadow over their "
"future."
msgstr ""
"Ko so do njih končno prišle okrepitve, je vilinom uspelo pregnati orkovsko "
"pleme. A grožnja iz severa je še naprej prežala na njih in metala temno "
"senco na njihovo prihodnost."

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:114
msgid "Alas, Erlornas, I have failed us..."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:120
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "All is lost! Without Linaera’s help, I cannot hope to defeat these "
#| "horrifying apparitions!"
msgid "All is lost! Without Linaera’s help, I cannot hope to succeed!"
msgstr ""
"Konec je! Brez Linaearine pomoči nimamo nobene možnosti pred temi groznimi "
"pošastmi!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lomarfel
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:138
msgid "Erlornas, you must defeat Rualsha! I have given my all..."
msgstr ""

